[{"title":"题钱宰吸光亭图","author":"陈傅良","text":"栖身云梦八九上，用意风雩五六间。\n惟有澄波兼皓月，尚怜波月蔽亏山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22546,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题瑞安宰朱元成乃祖云壑庄图","author":"陈傅良","text":"功成不受富贵污，轻舟翩然下五湖。\n至今风流在姑苏，我复见此云壑图。\n两坡乔木樛相扶，残山剩水千里馀。\n天际未知何有无，一苇横绝双风蒲。\n杨花春岸秋莼鲈，在在著此儒仙臞。\n世无宗师貌不如，谁其嗣之吾大夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22547,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题僧法传为沈仲一画听松图","author":"陈傅良","text":"古松不知几千年，直干欲上干青天。\n樛枝下与人世接，冷风过之万壑喧。\n猿惊鹤怪樵牧遁，百鬼愁绝谁傍边。\n纷纷海内丝竹耳，何处缥缈来臞仙。\n整襟拱听移永日，置琴弗顾僮攲眠。\n松风有际意无尽，庄骚不数惟易玄。\n嗟乎深山大泽松不乏，斯人往往千载之陈编。\n笔端若有夜半力，一日忽在轩楹前。\n止斋虚静对立久，晴昊亦为生苍烟。\n毕宏韦偃骨已朽，画工一世脂粉便。\n北湖居士安得此，奄有二子云山传。\n北湖居士云山传，吾诗孰与杜老起九原。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22548,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠尹绍伊","author":"陈傅良","text":"吾友尹绍伊，十年抱心疾。\n休然万事废，豆子黑如漆。\n从之问旧学，历历不遗一。\n佳篇间哇郑，法语杂方术。\n岂其遇人耶，托此访遗逸。\n张皇鬼物怪，漏泄宫禁密。\n君看服乌喙，孰与近参朮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22549,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠东阳吕望孙周登二武士","author":"陈傅良","text":"鸿门无人易水寒，安得壮士久所患。\n求之市隐戎行间，纷不当意鬓已班。\n逆胡未讨忧万端，此得两君聊自宽。\n有石堂坳立礤■，百夫睨之欲举难。\n两君挟起如弄丸，舞空一叶风团团。\n吕君忽作胡衣冠，沥酒于地盟血殷。\n长剑久倚燕然山，义欲为汉诛楼兰。\n九重深窈虎守关，竟以剑器博一餐。\n语未良已声珊珊，两蛟出没万马攒。\n夜阑月暗天汗漫，满堂悲愤泪欲潸。\n嗟尔两君诚义肝，我方乘障荆之蛮。\n五营诸将皆豢安，髀肉久不堪征鞍。\n谁能唤与百辟看，但得汝等一解吾君颜，书生老死不足叹。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22550,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠章虞卿","author":"陈傅良","text":"章子一别二十年，此来衔袖书一编。\n自出己意说百篇，至说五诰尤愕然。\n我今万事付幽屏，是书插架漫不省。\n子之书意吾已领，且探梅花试汤饼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22551,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"陈傅良","text":"苗分郑七穆，香发谢诸郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22552,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"陈傅良","text":"羲皇向上人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22553,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"陈傅良","text":"凝脂新赐浴，半面更啼红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22554,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"陈傅良","text":"梦由今日赉，事与古人求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22555,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"陈傅良","text":"玉龙十二蓬山顶，宝髻三千汉殿中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22556,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"陈傅良","text":"半妆宫面迎风笑，间色仙衣带露收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22557,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"陈傅良","text":"密叶自成金罽饰，乱英谁辑紫茸香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22558,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"陈博古","text":"门外海涛奔铁骑，槛前山背拥金鳌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22559,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和人","author":"陈善","text":"鲛绡巧织在深泉，不与人间机杼联。\n要知妙在笔墨外，第一莫为醒者传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22560,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏灵岩寺","author":"陈善","text":"山僧不好古，改作任所欲。\n洞荒径已迷，廊空响谁续。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22561,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红","author":"陈善","text":"三月风前花薄命，五更枕上春无力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22562,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"陈善","text":"闻说平生辅汉卿，武夷山下啜残羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22563,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"陈善","text":"春风一日归深院，巫峡千山锁暮云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22564,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"陈善","text":"不到沧浪亭上望，那知此句是天成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22565,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题黄敕背诗","author":"陈彭年甥","text":"彭年头脑太冬烘，眼似朱砂鬓似蓬。\n纰缪幸叨三字内，荒唐仍预四人中。\n放他权势欺明主，落却亲情卖至公。\n千百孤寒齐洒泪，斯言无路入尧聪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22566,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事","author":"陈揆","text":"谁家庭院冷萧萧，闭却朱门不许敲。\n惟有东风藏不得，隔墙露出杏花梢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22567,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"陈景沂","text":"色异味同失主张，厌寒附暖逐群芳。\n当知不改冰霜操，戏学陶家艳冶妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22568,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨柳 其四","author":"陈景沂","text":"为尔生来体态柔，因情感物寓风流。\n汝无血气何知觉，自是诗人想像求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22569,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨柳 其二","author":"陈景沂","text":"非绿非青曲雨尘，颠头倒尾乱江阴。\n金衣公子经过处，不辨其身只辨音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22570,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和杨公济钱塘西湖百题 其九十四 杨梅坞","author":"郭祥正","text":"红实缀青枝，烂漫照前坞。\n不及杏繁时，林间有仙虎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22571,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨梅 其二","author":"陈景沂","text":"止渴还相似，和羹谅亦同。\n不思五和里，调济荷元功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22572,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"陈景沂","text":"标薰江雪情偏韵，影墨窗蟾梦半回。\n耐冻有何香可述，雅交还喜淡相陪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22573,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其五","author":"陈景沂","text":"平生足迹遍天下，正一东嘉却弗来。\n行到刘山无所寄，谩留冷句伴江梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22574,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其三","author":"陈景沂","text":"行人立马闯烟梢，为底寒香尚寂寥。\n是则孤根未回暖，已应春意到溪桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22575,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其四","author":"陈景沂","text":"重岗复岭万千程，霜褪红稀步恰轻。\n瞥有暗香松下过，不知何处隐梅兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22576,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"陈景沂","text":"从来造化有何私，自是梅花南北枝。\n只为北枝太寒苦，东君消息故应迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22577,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葵花","author":"陈景沂","text":"人情物理要推求，不早敷黄隶晚秋。\n黄得十分虽好看，风霜争奈在前头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22578,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石榴花","author":"陈景沂","text":"阴霾渺渺接江乡，登陆犹褰未涉裳。\n入晚天容糊水色，拂明云影帽山光。\n闷拈昌歜嗟香玉，披读离骚玩彻章。\n最是荷榴两怀古，对人无语湿红妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22579,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"含笑花","author":"陈景沂","text":"此花枝叶山矾类，气味虽殊本共行。\n铁定青门瓜魄变，否因李白酒魂香。\n紫唇半吐胭脂重，素脸初开玉色装。\n懊恼酴醾诧名色，乱施冶鬓过低墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22580,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芦 其二","author":"陈景沂","text":"一一溪边石，堆成几别离。\n青蒲驶樯本，黄苇掠船墀。\n话别从今日，云来是几时。\n藏心栗黄蟹，归买配香炊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22581,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芦 其一","author":"陈景沂","text":"风雨萧萧夕，春寒灯较昏。\n茅檐数椽屋，荻浦几家村。\n网到江鳞活，沽来市酒浑。\n焙衾共结局，一觉眇乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22582,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松 其一","author":"陈景沂","text":"仙往径独在，亭高山若堆。\n知非凡木比，识得洞宾来。\n骨蜕栈沉水，坛缘薜荔栽。\n于何稚松子，有记弗详该。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22583,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"草 其一","author":"陈景沂","text":"淡烟荒草六朝宫，万感丛生一眺中。\n不识群公互虓虎，独于此地必争熊。\n秦河溅泪西风泣，淮巘含羞晚照红。\n酝得许多愁为底，祗缘误倚大江东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22584,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"草 其三","author":"陈景沂","text":"江城滕阁倚空寒，鹤势鶱飞远耐看。\n旁列西山青玉案，高擎南浦白银盘。\n摩挲王记犹无恙，拂拭韩碑尚未刓。\n翻忆赏心亭下水，草洲埋没贮愁酸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22585,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"草 其四","author":"陈景沂","text":"长淮何处雁声多，西去涡心北迈河。\n影逐泗滨烟月艇，阵惊亳邑水云蓑。\n小王草笔终难学，苏武陵书果若何。\n陲草边芦两萧索，远陪砌女作离歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22586,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"草 其二","author":"陈景沂","text":"未破滁阳亭屡易，亭亡今又几经年。\n峰回路转势不改，木秀阴繁直到巅。\n流下山泉音若咽，烧馀寺刻块如拳。\n柴王一殿今何在，衰草残烟护晓娟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22587,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桃花","author":"陈景沂","text":"江衔洞庭急，君山屹半川。\n别知江有国，大率水多仙。\n环绕八百里，洪濛十万年。\n晚春桃正碧，南客晓浮船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22588,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨柳 其三","author":"陈景沂","text":"相尚津涯临画舫，栽从亭馆近华筵。\n别离自是无聊赖，于甚垂杨有纠牵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22589,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨柳 其一","author":"陈景沂","text":"美笑千黄金，驻景双白璧。\n东风杨柳津，几度千丝碧。\n款款白面郎，画舫宫样妆。\n新堤五里长，回头意悠扬。\n幽人兴不忙，得志汀草芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22590,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松 其二","author":"陈景沂","text":"远吹疏疏奏竹房，乱撩松友发清狂。\n云拖雨阵沿山至，岩溲泉声走涧长。\n和我微吟似音律，续他高韵费思量。\n谁人宅里遗簪处，碧玉横钗十二行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22591,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牵牛花","author":"陈景沂","text":"牵牛易斯药，固特取其义。\n安用柔软蔓，曲为萦绊地。\n汝若不巧沿，何能可旁致。\n始者无附托，头脑极细殢。\n一得风动摇，四畔乱拈缀。\n搭著纤毫末，走上墙壁际。\n傥得梯此身，恋缠松竹外。\n吐花白而青，敷叶光且腻。\n裛露作娇态，舞风示豪气。\n便忘抑郁时，剩有誇逞意。\n诳言松和竹，如我兄与弟。\n下盼兰菊群，反欲眇其视。\n如此无忌惮，不过是瞒昧。\n教知早晚霜风高，杪表何曾见牛翠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22592,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"陈景沂","text":"自是司花别有神，要凭诗句写花真。\n风翻翠袖惬寒薄，雨湔红妆啼晕新。\n为困未眠娇欲吐，将唇微褪笑如嗔。\n牡丹芍药尤无那，君识莺声识燕身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22593,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水龙吟","author":"陈景沂","text":"阶前砌下新凉，嫩姿弱质婆娑小。\n仙家甚处，凤雏飞下，化成窈窕。\n尖叶参差，柔枝袅娜，体将玉造。\n自川葵放后，堂萱谢了，是园苑、无花草。\n自恨西风太早。\n逞芳容、紫围绯绕。\n管里低昂，篦头约略，空成懊恼。\n圆胎结就，小铃垂下，直开临□。\n□凡间谪堕，不如西帝，曾关宸抱。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22594,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"点绛唇","author":"陈景沂","text":"今古凡花，词人尚作词称庆。\n紫薇名盛。\n似得花之圣。\n为底时人，一曲稀流咏。\n花端正。\n花无郎病。\n病亦归之命。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22595,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壶中天/念奴娇","author":"陈景沂","text":"江邮湘驿。\n问暮年何事，暮冬行役。\n马首摇摇经历处，多少山南溪北。\n冷著烟扉，孤芳云掩，瞥见如相识。\n相逢相劳，如痴如诉如忆。\n最是近晓霜浓，初弦月挂，傅粉金鸾侧。\n冷淡生涯忧乐忘，不管冰檐雪壁。\n魁榜虚夸，调羹浪语，那里求真的。\n暗香来历，自家还要知得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22596,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"陈景沂","text":"海棠已入老娼籍，芍药初登童子科。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22597,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"陈景沂","text":"赋质太轻难作主，飘踪无著易粘人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22598,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀高东溪二首 其二","author":"陈景肃","text":"谔谔东溪士，吹箫涧谷春。\n一别阻云水，相思劳梦魂。\n五湖秋夜月，三岛春空云。\n璚标月夜见，玉唾云閒闻。\n何当一返驾，吟弄终乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22599,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀高东溪二首 其一","author":"陈景肃","text":"凿泉莫太深，太深井难汲。\n登山莫太高，太高顶难立。\n山顶仰可观，井渊俯可挹。\n那知鸿鹄飞，海杳无消息。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22600,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"试剑石","author":"陈景肃","text":"将军大宝剑，磨久苍崖斑。\n一日试利刃，断石倚两山。\n倒枕泉水碧，生光斗牛丹。\n至今胡虏过，目顾骨先寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22601,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题方干旧隐","author":"陈最","text":"百里青山数曲溪，茂林脩竹此高栖。\n相寻似访壶中景，他日重来路不迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22602,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建炎丞相成国吕忠穆公退老堂 其二","author":"陈棠","text":"解组归来万事休，买茅初葺一堂幽。\n绿筠晓月摇苍佩，红树春风散綵斿。\n鸥鹭心情虽退志，麒麟图画尚追求。\n行看驰驲趋丹陛，趁取閒时秉烛游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22603,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建炎丞相成国吕忠穆公退老堂 其一","author":"陈棠","text":"黄閤雍容静塞尘，淩烟功就便抽身。\n三年暂别长安日，五亩来追独乐春。\n槐鼎政须还国老，溪山聊且慰骚人。\n似闻天语传中使，行告廷臣设九宾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22604,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚步","author":"陈棠","text":"晚步沙头倚小晴，南山正与暮云横。\n栖鸦啼处野烟合，飞鸟去边孤月生。\n树暗风微花气度，溪深雨涨水痕平。\n夜阑衣湿迷归路，彷佛前村灯火明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22605,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登帢帻峰","author":"陈棠","text":"云碍虚檐日，风号老木秋。\n山城围晚翠，江槛俯寒流。\n世事悲苍狗，生涯付白鸥。\n烟尘犹在眼，浑欲不胜愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22606,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次韵 其二","author":"陈棣","text":"天恐花神漏泄香，故教酝酿待新凉。\n丹铅不御丰容浅，一洗尘凡时世妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22607,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次韵 其一","author":"陈棣","text":"翠葆低笼衣缕金，恼人风味在秋深。\n不缘月窟移仙种，安得尘寰有桂林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22608,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回文二绝 其二","author":"陈棣","text":"衣沾暗泪香凝怨，锦织新诗远寄愁。\n围减带销红玉瘦，粉慵妆浅翠蛾羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22609,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回文二绝 其一","author":"陈棣","text":"春晚落花飞藉草，月明惊鹊堕栖枝。\n人归望阔江天暮，梦断愁深夜漏迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22610,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵陈季陵元夕 其一","author":"陈棣","text":"山城灯火欲黄昏，湿雨疏梅暗小园。\n回首武林行乐地，太平风物似开元。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22611,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵陈季陵元夕 其三","author":"陈棣","text":"顾我每为惊座客，如君真是谪仙人。\n相逢不作寻常语，一笑同酬惨澹春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22612,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵陈季陵元夕 其二","author":"陈棣","text":"归休无赖曲眠肱，扫尽繁华只一灯。\n冷淡生涯吾旧物，前身疑是小乘僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22613,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵徐庭珍春日杂言十首 其十","author":"陈棣","text":"小儿造化本无心，孰为芳时作主人。\n唯有丹青留得住，好令昌辈写花真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22614,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵徐庭珍春日杂言十首 其九","author":"陈棣","text":"冶叶倡条过女墙，依然还作故园香。\n雄蜂雌蝶无聊赖，尽日颠狂有底忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22615,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵徐庭珍春日杂言十首 其八","author":"陈棣","text":"幽花野蔓竟谁栽，傍水盈盈一笑开。\n几许远携吟笔去，未应空掉酒船回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":22616,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]